  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`all(...)` içindeki her koşul doğruysa `True` verir; boş sözlükte de `True`.",
      "en": "`all(...)` gives `True` if every condition inside is true; for an empty dictionary too."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Koşul: `key in params and params[key] == value`, `for key, value in where.items()` üzerinden.",
      "en": "The condition: `key in params and params[key] == value`, over `for key, value in where.items()`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef filter_runs(runs, where):\n    found = []\n    for run in runs:\n        params = run[\"params\"]\n        if all(key in params and params[key] == value for key, value in where.items()):\n            found.append(run[\"run\"])\n    return found\n\n\nRUNS = [\n    {\"run\": 1, \"params\": {\"model\": \"baseline\"}, \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.75}},\n    {\"run\": 2, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 1},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.61}},\n    {\"run\": 3, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 5},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.81, \"val_f1\": 0.64}},\n    {\"run\": 4, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 10},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.6}},\n    {\"run\": 5, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 8},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.8, \"val_f1\": 0.62}},\n]\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {\"model\": \"forest\"}))\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 10}))\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {\"model\": \"tree\"}))\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {}))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef filter_runs(runs, where):\n    found = []\n    for run in runs:\n        params = run[\"params\"]\n        if all(key in params and params[key] == value for key, value in where.items()):\n            found.append(run[\"run\"])\n    return found\n\n\nRUNS = [\n    {\"run\": 1, \"params\": {\"model\": \"baseline\"}, \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.75}},\n    {\"run\": 2, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 1},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.61}},\n    {\"run\": 3, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 5},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.81, \"val_f1\": 0.64}},\n    {\"run\": 4, \"params\": {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 10},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.83, \"val_f1\": 0.6}},\n    {\"run\": 5, \"params\": {\"model\": \"forest\", \"max_depth\": 8},\n     \"metrics\": {\"val_accuracy\": 0.8, \"val_f1\": 0.62}},\n]\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {\"model\": \"forest\"}))\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {\"model\": \"logistic\", \"C\": 10}))\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {\"model\": \"tree\"}))\nprint(filter_runs(RUNS, {}))\n```"
    }
